# Refactor Plan — Skills Mandate

During Phase 4 on code-changing ticks, follow subcheckpoints in the window RITUAL. **Read each skill file before its subphase.** Announce: "Using `<skill-name>` to …"

## Subphase → skill (strict order)

| `refactor_subphase` | Read |
|---------------------|------|
| `plan` | `.agents/skills/request-refactor-plan/SKILL.md` then `.agents/skills/request-refactor-plan/HABITS.md` |
| `smell` | `.agents/skills/refactoring-expert/SKILL.md` |
| `execute` | `.agents/skills/refactoring-specialist/SKILL.md` |

Phase 5 verify: read **refactoring-specialist** again; run `validate_refactor_step.py`.

## Window intensity

| Window | When pipeline applies |
|--------|------------------------|
| **code-health** | Every code tick — set `refactor_subphase=plan` if no `REFACTOR_PLAN` for item |
| **worker-relay** | `fix()` / maintenance ticks; shared hooks/lib; skip (`none`) for CSS-only feature adds |
| **ux-relay** | Logic/hooks/shared components; skip (`none`) for CSS-only polish |

## Rules

- **No app edits** during `plan` or `smell` subphases
- **One plan step** per wake when `execute`
- **No freestyle refactor** — never skip the three named skills
- Bugs: Superpowers **systematic-debugging** first, then this pipeline
- Output plans to `REFACTOR_PLAN` via `state_api.sh` — not GitHub issues

## Phase 5 gate

```bash
python3 tools/cursor-loop/scripts/validate_refactor_step.py . \
  --loop-id <loop_id> --state-file <STATE.md path>
```

Must pass before `prepare_review_tick.sh --apply` when `refactor_subphase` is not `none`.
